; First Steps in Asturian / Asturianu (ast)
; MultiLang-ASM Kids
; ==========================================

mover box 10       ; Put 10 candies in the box
amestar box 5        ; Get 5 more candies (15)
restar box 2        ; Eat 2 candies (13 left!)
llamada_sistema box         ; Show the final candy count!
